@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config a owl:Class .
hpc:loglevel a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:ibmcloudgen2KeyFile a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:ibmcloudgen2SshFile a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:ibmcloudgen2ProvisionFile a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:ibmcloudgen2MachinePrefix a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Ibmcloudgen2config ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:Ibmcloudgen2template a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines two classes: `hpc:IBMCloudGen2Config` and `hpc:IBMCloudGen2Template`. It also defines four datatype properties for the `hpc:IBMCloudGen2Config` class, representing the parameters that can be found in the `ibmcloudgen2_config.json` file. The properties are `hpc:LogLevel`, `hpc:IBMCLOUDGEN2_KEY_FILE`, `hpc:IBMCLOUDGEN2_SSH_FILE`, `hpc:IBMCLOUDGEN2_PROVISION_FILE`, and `hpc:IBMCLOUDGEN2_MACHINE_PREFIX`. The domain of each property is `hpc:IBMCloudGen2Config`, and the range is `xsd:string`. No information was provided about the `ibmcloudgen2_templates.json` file, so no properties or classes were defined for it.
